%% VOTAR-347/348 — Pausa y reanudación de emergencia del comicio
%% UAT-01: pause() revierte castVote | UAT-03: getters siguen operativos | UAT-04: views AuditView sin whenNotPaused

sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Autoridad as Autoridad Electoral (PAUSER)
  participant Panel as Panel de Administración
  participant API as API Backend<br/>(EleccionController)
  participant Svc as PausaComicioService
  participant BC as BlockchainService
  participant RPC as Sepolia RPC
  participant Ballot as BallotContract
  participant Registry as VoteRegistry
  participant BUD as Boleta Única Digital
  actor Votante

  Autoridad->>Panel: Solicitar pausa de emergencia
  Panel->>API: POST /elecciones/:id/pausar { reason }
  API->>Svc: solicitarPausa → confirmarPausa (n-of-m)
  Svc->>BC: pause(electionId, reason)
  BC->>RPC: pause(reason) BallotContract + VoteRegistry
  RPC->>Ballot: whenNotPaused bloquea castSignedVote
  RPC->>Registry: whenNotPaused bloquea recordVote
  Ballot-->>RPC: Paused(account, reason)
  Svc->>API: UPDATE eleccion.pausada=true
  Svc-->>Panel: comicio pausado

  Votante->>BUD: Intenta emitir sufragio
  BUD->>BUD: eleccion.pausada → bloqueo UI (sin gas)
  Votante->>RPC: castSignedVote (bypass UI)
  RPC->>Ballot: revert EnforcedPause

  actor Auditor
  Auditor->>RPC: eth_call getParticipationStats
  RPC->>Registry: view (lectura OK — UAT-03/UAT-04)
  Registry-->>Auditor: stats transparentes durante pausa

  Autoridad->>Panel: Confirmar reanudación
  Panel->>API: POST /elecciones/:id/reanudar
  Svc->>BC: unpause(electionId)
  BC->>RPC: unpause() Ballot + Registry
  Svc->>API: UPDATE eleccion.pausada=false
